SUMMARY:Pie Pawty
DESCRIPTION:Do you love pie\, pups\, and pours? Us too! \nJoin us on Sunday\, June 7 from 2-4PM at the Pharmacy Bottle & Beverage in Downtown Cary for a Pie Pawty! In celebration of raising $1\,000 for Second Chance Pet Adoptions\, the team at the Pharmacy will get to pie Tim. Raffles\, adoptable dogs\, and more will be there for everyone to enjoy! \nBring your family\, pup\, and friends out to support local! We can’t wait to see you there! \n📍 120 E Chatham St\, Cary\, NC 27511 \n📅 Sunday\, June 7 from 2-4PM \n🎉 Pie Pawty
URL:https://secondchancenc.org/event/pie-pawty/
LOCATION:Pharmacy Bottle & Beverage\, 120 E Chatham St\, Cary\, NC\, 27511
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://secondchancenc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Internal_Events_FeaturedImage_PiePawty_060726.png
END:VEVENT
