SUMMARY:Rescue Brew Launch Party
DESCRIPTION:All are invited to join us at the Rescue Brew Launch Party on Saturday\, August 15 from 4:00 pm to 7:00 pm at Boxyard in RTP! Rescue Brew will be on tap and 6-packs will be available for purchase. There will be music and adoptable animals to meet with!!
URL:https://secondchancenc.org/event/rescue-brew-launch-party/
LOCATION:Boxyard RTP\, 900 Park Offices Dr.\, Durham\, NC\, 27713
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://secondchancenc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Internal_Events_FeaturedImage_RB26.png
END:VEVENT
