SUMMARY:Bark in the Park benefiting Second Chance Pet Adoptions
DESCRIPTION:Bring your doggo to the ballpark and cheer on the Durham Bulls and your purchase benefits Second Chance Pet Adoptions.  Tickets are $10 for humans and $5 for your pup. Purchase your tickets at the link below! \n⌚ Gates open at 5:30 p.m.\, first pitch is at 6:45 p.m. \n🔗 https://www.gofevo.com/group/Barkpark432 \n  \nBark in the Park benefiting Second Chance Pet Adoptions
URL:https://secondchancenc.org/event/bark-in-the-park-benefiting-second-chance-pet-adoptions-sept/
LOCATION:Durham Bulls Athletic Park\, 409 Blackwell Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://secondchancenc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Internal_Events_FeaturedImage_BITP.png
END:VEVENT
