SUMMARY:Evening of Pawsibilities
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, October 10 at 6 PM at the North Ridge Country Club for our 26th annual Evening of Pawsibilities Gala. We look forward to seeing you as we celebrate another amazing year of animal rescue. Further details to come\, so please subscribe to our eNewsletter to stay informed on ticket sales\, event details\, and timelines for the evening.
URL:https://secondchancenc.org/event/evening-of-pawsibilities/
LOCATION:North Ridge Country Club\, 6612 Falls of Neuse Road\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27615
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://secondchancenc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Web_Internal_Events_FeaturedImage_EOP.png
